    "detailed_description": "<h1>contact</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check more\u00a0 information on our discord!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exhilarating idle loot-based 3D infinite flow game where you adventure with beautiful waifus !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Reincarnation: World Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely travel through various worlds constructed in the infinite flow style. Collect equipment, pets, skills, etc. distributed across each world through battles. Continuously strengthen your strength by clearing levels and farming treasures, all the way to the end of reincarnation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/75018aae31b40ba73cc22e676a87d07c.poster.avif?t=1754565736\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/75018aae31b40ba73cc22e676a87d07c.webm?t=1754565736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/75018aae31b40ba73cc22e676a87d07c.mp4?t=1754565736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
